  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment - FAO Rome Emergency &amp; Rescilliance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekundering - FAO Rom, Emergency &amp; Rescilliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekunderingen kommer att tillhandah&#xe5;lla program-, policy- och partnerskapsst&#xf6;d i relation till FAO:s Emergency and Resilience Programming, med fokus p&#xe5; tv&#xe5;ngsf&#xf6;rflyttningar/migrationskontexter och h&#xe5;llbara l&#xf6;sningar, med fokus p&#xe5; prioriterade livsmedelskrisl&#xe4;nder. OER och FAO:s landskontor kommer att st&#xf6;djas genom tv&#xe5;ngsf&#xf6;rflyttning/migrationsrelaterad programdesign, i linje med FAO:s programpaket f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbara l&#xf6;sningar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The secondment will provide program, policy and partnership support in relation to FAO&apos;s Emergency and Resilience Programming, focusing on forced displacement/migration contexts and sustainable solutions, focusing on priority food crisis countries. OER and FAO country offices will be supported through forced displacement/migration-related program design, in line with FAO&apos;s Sustainable Solutions Program Package</narrative>
  </description>
